    "Hook 被停用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hooks disabled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScyllaUI 靠 Hook 得知各款 Agent 的状态：在它们的配置文件里写入几条命令，Agent 运行时把状态告诉侧栏。修复与撤销前都会先列出改动，写入前备份原文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScyllaUI learns each agent's status through hooks: a few commands written into the agent's config file report status to the sidebar while the agent runs. Repair and Remove always list the changes first and back up the original file before writing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "scyllauid 已连接，构建标识 %@（与 App 一致）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "scyllauid connected, build %@ (matches the app)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "scyllauid 已连接，构建标识 %@（与 App 不一致）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "scyllauid connected, build %@ (differs from the app)"
          }
