    "删除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除 ScyllaUI 库中全部已结束的对话，正在运行的任务与 Agent 自己的会话记录不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deletes every ended task from ScyllaUI's database. Running tasks and the agent's own session history are not affected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除本项目的 %lld 条": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Remove ScyllaUI's %lld entry"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Remove ScyllaUI's %lld entries"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除本项目的标记块": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove ScyllaUI's marker block"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消置顶": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unpin Project"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "置顶项目": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pin Project"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只删除 ScyllaUI 写入的条目，您自己的 Hook 与其他设置不动。撤销后侧栏收不到 %@ 的状态，只能显示运行或退出。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the entries ScyllaUI wrote are removed; your own hooks and other settings stay as they are. Afterwards the sidebar no longer receives %@'s status and can only show whether it is running or has exited."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 的信任记录与 Hook 功能开关保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex's trust records and hooks feature switch are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只影响 ScyllaUI 自己的库；侧栏「最近任务」只显示近 14 天内的 20 条。Claude Code 默认 30 天后删除本地会话，超过它的记录多半已无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Affects only ScyllaUI's own database; Recent in the sidebar shows at most 20 tasks from the last 14 days. Claude Code deletes local sessions after 30 days by default, so older tasks usually can't be resumed anyway."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看待处理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pending only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只看待处理（需确认、待查看）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show pending only (needs approval, unread)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台没有给出原因。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The background service didn't give a reason."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台进不了这个终端的启动目录，Shell 已在其他目录启动，没有代输启动命令。可在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 文件与文件夹」中允许 ScyllaUI 访问，再新开终端。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScyllaUI's background service couldn't open this terminal's start folder, so the shell started in another folder and the launch command was not typed. Allow ScyllaUI in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files and Folders, then open a new terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daemon:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Finder 中显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在文件末尾写入本项目的标记块（%lld 条 [[hooks]]）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Append ScyllaUI's marker block at the end of the file (%lld [[hooks]] entry)"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Append ScyllaUI's marker block at the end of the file (%lld [[hooks]] entries)"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "外观": {
      "localizations": {
