    "删除记录…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete Record…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重启电脑或后台被结束后，下次打开 ScyllaUI 时把终端开回原来的目录，原来跑着的 Agent 对话接着恢复。退出 App 不影响终端，不需要恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After a restart or if the background process was stopped, ScyllaUI reopens your terminals in their last directories the next time it opens, and resumes the agent conversations that were running. Quitting the app doesn't affect terminals, so nothing needs restoring."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这次没有自动恢复 %lld 个终端。它们的 Agent 对话都在「最近任务」里，也可以双击逐个恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "ScyllaUI didn't restore %lld terminal automatically this time. Its agent conversation is in Recent; you can also double-click it there to resume it."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "ScyllaUI didn't restore %lld terminals automatically this time. Their agent conversations are in Recent; you can also double-click them one by one."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
