    "去信任…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trust…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Codex 里信任 ScyllaUI 的 Hook": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trust ScyllaUI's hooks in Codex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 Codex 里打开 /hooks": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open /hooks in Codex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在 ScyllaUI 的终端里打开 Codex：它启动时若询问是否信任新的 Hook（Hooks need review），选「Trust all and continue」；没有询问时，侧栏那一行会出现「未同步」，点它即可。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Codex in a ScyllaUI terminal. If it asks whether to trust new hooks (Hooks need review), choose “Trust all and continue”. If it doesn't ask, its sidebar row shows “Not synced” — click that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填入 /hooks": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insert /hooks"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将在这个终端的 Codex 输入行填入 /hooks，不回车。按回车打开 Codex 的 Hook 列表，再按 t 信任全部待审核的条目（按回车可逐条审核）；列表里没有时，退出 Codex 再打开，它会询问是否信任。这一步只能由您在 Codex 里确认，ScyllaUI 不代写信任记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScyllaUI will type /hooks into Codex's input line in this terminal without pressing Return. Press Return to open Codex's hook list, then press t to trust all hooks awaiting review (or Return to review them one by one). If they aren't listed, quit Codex and open it again; it will ask whether to trust them. Only you can confirm this in Codex — ScyllaUI never writes trust records for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有终端没能接回 Agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some terminals couldn't bring their agents back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未同步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not synced"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有正在运行的 Codex": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex isn't running"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还差一步：在 Codex 里信任 ScyllaUI 的 Hook": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One more step: trust ScyllaUI's hooks in Codex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这款 Agent 的状态同步未生效，侧栏看不到它在做什么。点按查看并修复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Status sync isn't working for this agent, so the sidebar can't see what it's doing. Click to review and fix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "收到无法解析的 Hook 数据": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Received hook data that couldn't be parsed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hook 数据缺少事件名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hook data is missing the event name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "hooks 写成了行内数组（hooks = […]），ScyllaUI 只支持 [[hooks]] 写法，未改动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The hooks are written as an inline array (hooks = […]). ScyllaUI only supports the [[hooks]] form, so nothing was changed."
