            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not verified"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在终端里运行的版本。「已验证」表示 ScyllaUI 测过这个版本的状态同步；未验证的版本通常也能正常使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The version running in a terminal. “Verified” means ScyllaUI has tested status sync with this version; unverified versions usually work fine too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最近一次对话时的版本。「已验证」表示 ScyllaUI 测过这个版本的状态同步；未验证的版本通常也能正常使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The version from the most recent conversation. “Verified” means ScyllaUI has tested status sync with this version; unverified versions usually work fine too."
