      }
    },
    "崩溃报告可能带有崩溃瞬间内存里的文字，例如终端里正在显示的内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crash reports may contain text that was in memory at the moment of the crash, such as what a terminal was showing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "帮助": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Help"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "报告问题": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Report a Problem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "报告问题…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Report a Problem…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "日志里只有事件与状态，不含提示词、回复和密钥；家目录已写成 ~，目录名仍可见。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Logs contain only events and states — no prompts, replies or keys. Your home folder is written as ~; folder names are still visible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有找到可用的邮件账户": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No email account available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "版本：%@（构建标识 %@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version: %1$@ (build ID %2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用邮件发送…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send by Email…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "诊断包已在 Finder 中显示。请用您常用的邮箱把它发到 %@，或改用「在 GitHub 提交…」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The diagnostic package is shown in Finder. Send it to %@ from your usual email, or use “Submit on GitHub…” instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "诊断包打包失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t package the diagnostics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "诊断包生成失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t create the diagnostic package"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "诊断包：%@（见附件）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostics: %@ (attached)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "诊断包：请把 %@ 拖到这里": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostics: please drag %@ here"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问题描述（发生了什么、大约几点、怎么复现）：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe the problem (what happened, roughly when, how to reproduce it):"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "附上崩溃报告（%lld 份）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Attach %lld crash report"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Attach %lld crash reports"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "（请描述发生了什么、大约几点、怎么复现）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "(Please describe what happened, roughly when, and how to reproduce it)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "遇到问题，告诉我们": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run into a problem? Let us know"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "您的每一条反馈对我们都非常宝贵和重要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every piece of feedback you send is valuable and important to us."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些情况都欢迎报告": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Please report any of these"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "侧栏的状态和 Agent 实际不一致，比如已经答完还显示 Running": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sidebar status doesn’t match what the agent is actually doing — for example, it still shows Running after the agent has finished"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "终端显示错乱、卡住，或者输入没反应": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A terminal shows garbled output, freezes, or doesn’t respond to typing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 闪退，或者下次打开时提示「上次意外退出」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app crashes, or says it “quit unexpectedly” the next time you open it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用着别扭、看不懂的地方，或者您希望有的功能": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anything awkward or confusing, or a feature you’d like to have"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "怎么报告": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How to report"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点菜单栏「帮助 › 报告问题…」。出问题时弹出的提示框里也有同名按钮。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Help › Report a Problem… in the menu bar. Alerts about problems have the same button."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写下发生了什么、大约几点、怎么复现。时间最重要，日志靠时间对上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Describe what happened, roughly when, and how to reproduce it. The time matters most — logs are matched by time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先看一眼诊断包：里面有版本、各 Agent 的状态同步、最近 3 天的日志和崩溃报告，可以在 Finder 里逐个打开查看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take a look at the diagnostic package first: it has versions, each agent’s status sync, the last 3 days of logs and crash reports, and you can open each file in Finder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选用邮件或 GitHub 发出。用的是您自己的账号；GitHub 上的问题是公开的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send it by email or on GitHub, using your own account. Issues on GitHub are public."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "诊断包在您的 Mac 上生成，不含提示词、回复和密钥，ScyllaUI 不会自动上传任何内容。也可以直接发邮件到 %@，或在 %@ 提交。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The diagnostic package is created on your Mac and contains no prompts, replies or keys; ScyllaUI never uploads anything on its own. You can also email %1$@ directly, or open an issue at %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "隐私说明…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Privacy Notice…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先把 ScyllaUI 拖到「应用程序」": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move ScyllaUI to Applications First"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScyllaUI 现在是从下载的磁盘映像或临时位置打开的。这样运行时，终端后台会从临时位置启动，系统也记不住你给的授权。请退出后，把 ScyllaUI 拖到「应用程序」文件夹，再从那里打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScyllaUI is running from a downloaded disk image or a temporary location. Run this way, its terminal background process starts from a temporary place and macOS can't remember the permissions you grant. Quit, drag ScyllaUI into the Applications folder, and open it from there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仍然打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Anyway"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次检查：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last checked: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从「应用程序」打开 ScyllaUI 后才能检查更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScyllaUI can check for updates once it is opened from the Applications folder."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更新：": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Updates:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查更新…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check for Updates…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自动检查更新": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatically check for updates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有检查过更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not checked for updates yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用须知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScyllaUI 是开源软件，按 GPL-3.0-or-later 发布。使用前请了解以下几点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScyllaUI is open-source software released under GPL-3.0-or-later. Here are a few things to know before you use it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之后可在「设置 › 关于」里查看使用须知与开源许可全文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can view this notice and the full open-source license later in Settings › About."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ScyllaUI 是自由软件，按 GNU GPL 3.0 或更高版本发布，不提供任何担保。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ScyllaUI is free software released under the GNU GPL version 3 or later, with no warranty."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开源许可…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open-Source License…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用须知…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notice…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有安装更新": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update Not Installed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装更新需要管理员授权：ScyllaUI 在「应用程序」里，当前账户无权替换它。刚才弹出的英文授权框（ScyllaUI wants permission to update）就是这一步。\n\n需要更新时，请再点「ScyllaUI › 检查更新…」，由管理员输入名称和密码；或请管理员登录后更新。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installing the update needs an administrator's approval: ScyllaUI is in the Applications folder, and this account can't replace it. The prompt that just appeared (ScyllaUI wants permission to update) is that step.\n\nTo update, choose ScyllaUI › Check for Updates… again and have an administrator enter their name and password, or ask an administrator to update while logged in."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
